WEBVTT

01:18.390 --> 01:21.789
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.920 --> 01:24.760
[Episode 15]

01:25.400 --> 01:26.070
Of course,

01:26.760 --> 01:28.270
we don't want to see Xinxin Vision

01:28.270 --> 01:29.200
end like this.

01:29.680 --> 01:32.180
Our CFO prepared a plan for you.

01:32.560 --> 01:33.710
Before the spin-off,

01:33.710 --> 01:35.710
if you find an investor to take over,

01:36.070 --> 01:38.530
we can cooperate
with the handover process.

01:42.350 --> 01:44.810
I will definitely find someone
to take over.

01:44.920 --> 01:45.960
I won't give up.

01:48.990 --> 01:51.470
The capital market is just that cruel.

01:51.710 --> 01:55.070
You don't always get rewarded just
because you put in the effort.

01:55.070 --> 01:55.940
Just like you,

01:56.070 --> 01:59.350
the sponsor institution responsible
for the group's listing this time

01:59.350 --> 02:00.880
has also taught me a lesson.

02:02.070 --> 02:03.200
He Jing Securities?

02:03.830 --> 02:04.630
That's right.

02:06.950 --> 02:08.320
A friend of mine also participated in

02:08.320 --> 02:09.479
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group's

02:09.479 --> 02:10.479
IPO sponsorship.

02:13.280 --> 02:14.070
Who is it?

02:14.670 --> 02:16.070
We might know each other.

02:17.950 --> 02:19.150
Qian Fei from He Jing.

02:20.790 --> 02:21.880
So it's her.

02:23.000 --> 02:24.660
Since Qian Fei is your friend,

02:24.880 --> 02:26.320
you should know

02:26.600 --> 02:29.390
that the entire group's
asset revaluation plan this time

02:29.390 --> 02:31.790
was single-handedly orchestrated by her.

02:31.950 --> 02:35.170
You could say the spin-off
of Xinxin Vision

02:35.280 --> 02:37.320
was driven by her suggestion.

02:55.160 --> 02:57.360
Beautiful, are you alone?

02:57.630 --> 02:58.600
You're here?

03:01.110 --> 03:02.550
What happened?

03:03.390 --> 03:05.850
Didn't you burn your books
after graduation

03:05.880 --> 03:07.630
and swear you'd never study again?

03:07.630 --> 03:09.160
Taking notes so seriously?

03:09.350 --> 03:11.110
An original English edition?

03:11.880 --> 03:13.100
Not bad.

03:14.090 --> 03:16.290
You didn't even tell me you were coming.

03:16.480 --> 03:18.390
Isn't it because there was no comparison?

03:18.390 --> 03:19.000
You know what?

03:19.000 --> 03:20.000
My tenant

03:20.000 --> 03:21.480
is incredibly picky.

03:21.480 --> 03:23.630
He just cares about his looks
and does no work.

03:23.630 --> 03:25.760
He wishes he never had to lift a finger.

03:25.880 --> 03:26.760
I don't take

03:26.760 --> 03:28.490
a guy like him seriously at all.

03:30.230 --> 03:31.950
I always thought

03:32.790 --> 03:34.320
he was just total eye candy.

03:35.160 --> 03:36.880
Until one day I suddenly realized

03:36.880 --> 03:38.040
he's not eye candy.

03:38.200 --> 03:39.630
He actually has real skills.

03:39.630 --> 03:40.920
He just casually shows off a skill,

03:40.920 --> 03:42.280
and it blows your mind.

03:42.390 --> 03:44.350
Living with someone like him every day,

03:44.350 --> 03:45.550
how could I not learn?

03:47.880 --> 03:48.440
I get it.

03:49.480 --> 03:51.670
You were inspired
by your arrogant little tenant,

03:51.670 --> 03:53.360
weren't you?

03:54.110 --> 03:57.180
Back then,
Wang Ruohai used all kinds of harsh words

03:57.280 --> 03:58.630
to force you to study,

03:59.040 --> 04:02.100
but couldn't even get you
to move an inch out of bed.

04:02.510 --> 04:03.620
But look at you now.

04:04.520 --> 04:05.120
Thank you.

04:06.230 --> 04:07.860
How did a little tenant

04:07.990 --> 04:09.590
give you so much motivation?

04:10.280 --> 04:10.740
Well...

04:10.870 --> 04:13.100
Because Wang Ruohai was close to me.

04:13.190 --> 04:15.670
I didn't need to care about my face
in front of him.

04:15.670 --> 04:17.550
When he called me lazy,
I just accepted it.

04:17.550 --> 04:19.680
When he called me shameless, I took it.

04:19.920 --> 04:21.380
But Li Yifei is different.

04:21.399 --> 04:23.090
He's an outsider.

04:23.520 --> 04:24.850
In front of an outsider,

04:25.280 --> 04:25.720
you...

04:26.110 --> 04:27.630
have to prove yourself.

04:29.310 --> 04:29.840
Wait.

04:30.230 --> 04:32.580
Why did you suddenly mention Wang Ruohai?

04:35.110 --> 04:35.570
Well...

04:35.750 --> 04:36.400
I mean...

04:36.400 --> 04:38.040
You were the one who brought him up first.

04:38.040 --> 04:39.400
You called me first and said

04:39.400 --> 04:41.040
he was causing trouble for you again.

04:41.040 --> 04:43.690
I came here to help you out.

04:43.720 --> 04:45.650
You can't turn around and blame me.

04:45.750 --> 04:46.920
It really is a pain.

04:48.280 --> 04:48.920
I mean,

04:49.720 --> 04:51.400
working with my ex

04:51.400 --> 04:52.920
in the same place is bad enough.

04:52.920 --> 04:54.920
Working with my ex-boyfriend's

04:54.920 --> 04:56.320
current girlfriend now?

04:56.400 --> 04:57.430
So frustrating.

04:58.870 --> 05:00.990
I was the one who got dumped.

05:01.800 --> 05:03.870
I've moved on,
and I'm completely fine now.

05:03.870 --> 05:04.880
Yet he's been

05:05.040 --> 05:06.920
acting awkward and whining every day,

05:06.920 --> 05:08.520
keeping his distance from me.

05:08.520 --> 05:09.540
He might as well

05:09.720 --> 05:11.450
kick me out of the sponsor team.

05:11.670 --> 05:12.870
Such a pain in the ass.

05:14.400 --> 05:16.600
What if he really kicks you out?

05:17.110 --> 05:18.750
Then I'll just fight my way back.

05:18.750 --> 05:20.880
It's not like I haven't done it before.

05:23.190 --> 05:23.880
That's it?

05:25.720 --> 05:27.310
I thought you were so tough.

05:27.310 --> 05:29.080
You should at least
drag him down with you.

05:29.080 --> 05:30.280
You're all talk.

05:31.430 --> 05:33.640
Well, you're so tough

05:33.930 --> 05:34.909
and capable,

05:35.040 --> 05:37.159
but don't you still have to wait for Lu Ze
to get off work?

05:37.159 --> 05:38.470
Is that the same?

05:38.840 --> 05:40.159
How is it different?

05:42.110 --> 05:43.690
Why is he here today?

05:44.400 --> 05:45.250
I don't know.

05:45.430 --> 05:46.670
I went to his company to look for him,

05:46.670 --> 05:47.430
but he wasn't there.

05:47.430 --> 05:48.400
They said he was here,

05:48.400 --> 05:49.040
so I just

05:49.400 --> 05:51.230
came over since I had nothing to do.

05:51.230 --> 05:52.030
To pick him up.

05:52.520 --> 05:53.320
To pick him up?

05:53.750 --> 05:55.350
-Oh, so sweet.
-By the way...

05:55.480 --> 05:56.340
This is for you.

06:04.750 --> 06:05.280
Isn't...

06:05.750 --> 06:07.550
Isn't this the teddy bear
from the other day?

06:07.550 --> 06:09.520
We didn't reach 2,000 that day,

06:09.520 --> 06:10.550
so they wouldn't give it to us.

06:10.550 --> 06:11.600
I went back over the weekend,

06:11.600 --> 06:13.400
spent enough, and got it for you.

06:13.520 --> 06:14.450
It's so cute!

06:14.550 --> 06:15.960
It's so chubby!

06:16.040 --> 06:16.880
Do you like it?

06:20.230 --> 06:20.960
I don't.

06:22.190 --> 06:22.640
But...

06:23.400 --> 06:24.360
Don't you think

06:24.600 --> 06:26.400
it looks exactly like
my tenant?

06:27.280 --> 06:28.990
Look at this little gold button

06:28.990 --> 06:30.320
and this suit.

06:30.430 --> 06:31.600
Especially how it acts

06:31.600 --> 06:32.990
all innocent and pitiful.

06:32.990 --> 06:33.980
It's so annoying.

06:33.980 --> 06:35.240
I'll beat you to death!

06:35.640 --> 06:37.240
Something's wrong with you.

06:39.110 --> 06:41.860
A teddy bear can remind you of him?

06:41.980 --> 06:44.980
You can't go 3 sentences
without mentioning Li Yifei.

06:45.790 --> 06:47.409
You have a thing for him.

06:47.640 --> 06:49.400
I knew you were going to say that.

06:49.400 --> 06:51.530
There's nothing. Don't overthink it.

06:53.960 --> 06:54.840
Forget it. Take it.

06:54.840 --> 06:55.890
It annoys me just looking at it.

06:55.890 --> 06:56.670
No, no, no.

06:56.670 --> 06:58.400
I can't take it if that's the case.

06:58.400 --> 06:59.980
It would be inappropriate for me

06:59.980 --> 07:01.380
to take your tenant back.

07:03.790 --> 07:04.770
I got it.

07:05.080 --> 07:06.670
Next time he provokes you

07:06.670 --> 07:07.790
and makes you upset,

07:07.790 --> 07:09.720
just prick this bear with a needle.

07:09.750 --> 07:10.280
Prick it.

07:10.640 --> 07:11.080
Prick it

07:11.080 --> 07:11.670
to vent my anger!

07:11.670 --> 07:12.230
Prick, prick!

07:12.230 --> 07:13.480
Prick, prick, prick!

07:15.430 --> 07:16.230
If he knows...

07:16.550 --> 07:17.630
How mean!

07:18.520 --> 07:20.310
Prick it. Prick it! Prick, prick, prick!

07:20.310 --> 07:21.840
Beat him. Beat him!

07:23.280 --> 07:24.520
He'll be so mad if he finds out.

07:24.520 --> 07:25.400
How mean.

07:29.040 --> 07:29.670
Honey.

07:30.640 --> 07:31.310
You're here?

07:31.310 --> 07:32.190
You're finally here.

07:32.190 --> 07:33.990
Hurry up and take your wife away.

07:36.080 --> 07:38.420
You two chat for a bit.
I need to take a call.

07:40.550 --> 07:41.600
Hello? Go ahead.

07:47.750 --> 07:50.350
Why did you suddenly
come to the company today?

07:51.040 --> 07:52.570
Don't you know why I'm here?

07:58.520 --> 08:00.650
I'm here to negotiate with Liao Shiyu.

08:00.920 --> 08:01.820
Negotiate?

08:02.040 --> 08:03.640
Why do you need to negotiate?

08:07.550 --> 08:08.720
Qian Fei, do you know

08:09.670 --> 08:11.470
your place in Jingjing's heart?

08:13.430 --> 08:14.380
What do you mean?

08:15.080 --> 08:16.740
You are not just best friends;

08:16.840 --> 08:18.230
you are sisters and family.

08:18.230 --> 08:20.630
You're even more important to her
than I am.

08:22.000 --> 08:23.490
Even when she pulls an all-nighter,

08:23.490 --> 08:24.830
if she hears that you're in trouble,

08:24.830 --> 08:27.000
she'll immediately run over to cry with you,
laugh with you,

08:27.000 --> 08:28.930
drink for you, and stand up for you,

08:29.000 --> 08:30.600
without a single complaint.

08:33.760 --> 08:35.289
We are about to get married.

08:37.360 --> 08:39.190
She is watching my career take off,

08:39.190 --> 08:40.480
full of joy,

08:41.049 --> 08:43.400
thinking we can go public
with Shan Li Fang,

08:43.400 --> 08:44.430
cash in the equity,

08:44.430 --> 08:46.000
and live a stable life.

08:46.120 --> 08:47.670
Even last night she was telling me

08:47.670 --> 08:50.520
to make sure we bring you along
when we go out to have fun.

08:50.520 --> 08:51.590
But what did you do?

08:56.710 --> 08:57.550
Qian Fei.

09:00.760 --> 09:02.470
You planned

09:02.470 --> 09:03.790
the entire spin-off of Xinxin Vision

09:03.790 --> 09:05.280
before Shan Li Fang goes public.

09:05.280 --> 09:07.120
Why didn't you tell me?

09:07.950 --> 09:09.710
You could have at least told Jingjing.

09:09.710 --> 09:11.430
I was caught completely off guard.

09:11.430 --> 09:11.890
Come on.

09:12.950 --> 09:14.790
I really don't understand.

09:15.430 --> 09:15.980
What?

09:16.160 --> 09:18.760
Shan Li Fang is going to
spin off Xinxin Vision?

09:18.760 --> 09:20.000
I didn't know about this.

09:20.000 --> 09:22.550
You don't have to be like this.
We are all adults.

09:22.550 --> 09:26.480
-Wait, I really don't know.
-You don't need to play dumb here, Qian Fei.

09:27.430 --> 09:28.840
Liao Shiyu told me

09:28.920 --> 09:30.720
you planned the whole proposal.

09:32.160 --> 09:34.360
-Wait, Lu Ze...
-I will find a solution.

09:35.120 --> 09:36.950
Xinxin Vision
won't be finished off like this.

09:36.950 --> 09:37.750
You really...

09:37.830 --> 09:38.360
heard...

09:38.830 --> 09:40.280
So annoying.

09:40.280 --> 09:42.070
There's a problem with my next project.

09:42.070 --> 09:43.280
Take me to the office.

09:43.470 --> 09:43.950
Okay.

09:45.120 --> 09:46.070
We're leaving now.

09:46.070 --> 09:46.640
Okay.

09:46.640 --> 09:47.710
-Bye-bye.
-Bye-bye.

09:47.710 --> 09:49.190
Hurry up. I'm in a rush.

09:49.600 --> 09:50.710
Seriously.

09:50.790 --> 09:55.250
-He insisted on letting me go because he couldn't solve it.
-Alright. Calm down.

11:43.790 --> 11:45.590
I just read Xinxin Vision's materials.

11:45.590 --> 11:46.380
Is it confirmed

11:46.380 --> 11:47.850
that it will be spun off?

11:48.170 --> 11:49.000
Gently.

11:49.590 --> 11:50.480
Are you okay?

11:51.190 --> 11:52.040
Never better.

11:54.760 --> 11:55.920
But the plan I made

11:55.920 --> 11:57.810
didn't involve Xinxin Vision.

11:58.720 --> 12:01.080
The plan you made is just a framework.

12:01.590 --> 12:03.550
When it comes to actual implementation,

12:03.550 --> 12:05.550
it wouldn't be as simple as on paper.

12:05.550 --> 12:06.610
Do you understand?

12:07.000 --> 12:09.000
As for the part about Xinxin Vision,

12:09.070 --> 12:10.670
I checked it personally.

12:11.920 --> 12:12.830
You also said

12:12.830 --> 12:14.560
you have read their materials.

12:14.830 --> 12:17.490
You can't possibly not know
what the problem is.

12:17.750 --> 12:18.680
Are you alright?

12:19.160 --> 12:19.690
I'm fine.

12:24.120 --> 12:26.020
Is there no other way?

12:26.070 --> 12:27.470
Many products developed by their company

12:27.470 --> 12:29.160
are indeed very socially valuable.

12:29.160 --> 12:30.630
Without those products,

12:31.120 --> 12:32.470
when staying in hotels now,

12:32.470 --> 12:35.680
I'd have to bring
my own bath towel and sleeping bag.

12:35.790 --> 12:37.590
I would never feel quite at ease.

12:37.670 --> 12:39.800
How cheap are the hotels you stay in?

12:40.040 --> 12:41.120
I'm being serious!

12:43.760 --> 12:44.040
Yes, ma'am.

12:44.040 --> 12:45.240
Let's go over there.

12:46.120 --> 12:46.910
Yes, ma'am.

12:47.520 --> 12:47.980
Well...

12:48.190 --> 12:51.340
Why do you care so much
about Xinxin Vision?

12:53.190 --> 12:55.450
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group committed fraud

12:55.550 --> 12:58.600
and overestimated Xinxin Vision's

12:58.760 --> 13:00.190
appraised value and its proportion
of intangible assets.

13:00.190 --> 13:00.750
But...

13:00.780 --> 13:02.530
It was not Xinxin Vision's fault.

13:02.530 --> 13:05.860
Why should they bear the consequences
during the re-audit?

13:06.400 --> 13:08.190
I remember you were at

13:08.190 --> 13:09.070
the venture capital forum earlier too.

13:09.070 --> 13:10.640
Didn't you see Lu Ze's roadshow?

13:10.640 --> 13:11.640
It was wonderful.

13:12.430 --> 13:13.760
Yeah, I saw it.

13:16.400 --> 13:18.200
A formulaic roadshow.

13:18.710 --> 13:20.530
A prime example of empty talk.

13:21.360 --> 13:22.520
How can you say that?

13:26.710 --> 13:28.460
Xinxin Vision...

13:30.250 --> 13:32.120
Not only are their financial statements
poor,

13:32.120 --> 13:35.400
but they also haven't developed
any new products

13:35.400 --> 13:37.660
ready for launch in the past three years.

13:38.000 --> 13:39.850
Shan Li Fang's investment in it

13:40.280 --> 13:41.000
used to be

13:41.520 --> 13:42.620
about ideals.

13:43.360 --> 13:44.350
Later,

13:44.880 --> 13:47.770
it became a tool
for Chairman Liao to make money.

13:48.470 --> 13:50.580
The valuation of intangible assets

13:50.760 --> 13:53.090
is the easiest area to exploit loopholes.

13:53.470 --> 13:55.710
In the capital market, Xinxin Vision

13:55.710 --> 13:57.470
has no value anymore.

13:58.000 --> 14:00.400
Otherwise, why wouldn't anyone take over?

14:00.760 --> 14:02.220
Investors aren't stupid.

14:02.880 --> 14:03.340
So if...

14:04.090 --> 14:05.360
it's going to be spun off

14:05.360 --> 14:08.160
and no other company takes over,

14:08.430 --> 14:09.590
doesn't that mean

14:09.590 --> 14:11.470
all its previous efforts

14:11.550 --> 14:12.830
are in vain?

14:13.000 --> 14:13.490
Yes.

14:13.880 --> 14:17.350
The capital market is just that cruel.

14:17.590 --> 14:19.280
Then you should think of a way.

14:19.280 --> 14:21.020
Give me an idea.

14:28.880 --> 14:29.950
Alright.

14:30.880 --> 14:32.670
I thought about all the possibilities

14:32.670 --> 14:35.170
of saving it before you did.

14:35.430 --> 14:38.360
But if you look at it
from Shan Li Fang's perspective,

14:38.710 --> 14:39.390
now,

14:39.710 --> 14:41.430
any factors that could hinder

14:41.430 --> 14:42.830
a successful IPO

14:42.830 --> 14:43.960
must be eliminated.

14:44.070 --> 14:46.290
Xinxin Vision has too much debt,

14:46.880 --> 14:47.500
you know?

14:48.400 --> 14:49.710
The best way

14:50.400 --> 14:51.400
is to get rid of it.

14:52.310 --> 14:53.040
Understand?

14:53.830 --> 14:54.830
Be professional.

14:57.430 --> 15:00.090
Your massage technique
is quite professional.

15:02.760 --> 15:04.560
-Let me help you.
-You know what?

15:05.430 --> 15:06.830
I can practice a bit more.

15:07.640 --> 15:08.900
Does it hurt that much?

15:11.550 --> 15:12.000
I must say,

15:12.000 --> 15:14.200
that massage you gave me really helped.

15:16.890 --> 15:18.870
Then you can go back in my car later.

15:18.950 --> 15:20.280
You're being this nice?

15:21.360 --> 15:22.640
Are you plotting

15:22.640 --> 15:24.400
some kind of scheme?

15:24.790 --> 15:25.790
I see.

15:25.950 --> 15:28.210
You want me to cook what you order, right?

15:28.550 --> 15:30.190
Why are you so petty?

15:30.310 --> 15:32.910
What scheme could there be
in giving you a ride?

15:34.120 --> 15:36.250
I noticed the fingerprint lock at home

15:36.520 --> 15:38.000
seemed broken yesterday.

15:38.000 --> 15:39.550
It doesn't recognize my face anymore.

15:39.550 --> 15:40.920
Re-scan my face when we get back.

15:40.920 --> 15:42.120
Look how bad you are.

15:42.160 --> 15:43.310
Even the fingerprint lock rejects you.

15:43.310 --> 15:44.840
Do you know what that means?

15:45.160 --> 15:46.910
I suspect you broke it.

15:47.400 --> 15:48.800
You're full of bad ideas.

15:49.920 --> 15:51.770
Are you doing everything you can,

15:51.770 --> 15:52.970
racking your brains,

15:53.280 --> 15:54.610
just to not live with me?

15:55.040 --> 15:56.950
I've always been open and aboveboard.

15:56.950 --> 15:59.280
Do you think
I'd stoop to such sneaky tricks?

15:59.280 --> 15:59.950
Zhao De.

16:00.240 --> 16:02.090
Boss, I didn't hear anything.

16:02.830 --> 16:04.110
Just say it.

16:04.550 --> 16:06.940
Boss, I heard everything.

16:07.070 --> 16:09.310
I felt there was something fishy
when you two talked earlier.

16:09.310 --> 16:10.690
What's going on?

16:10.710 --> 16:12.970
You two are living together, aren't you?

16:13.000 --> 16:13.900
Is it a romantic relationship?

16:13.900 --> 16:15.390
Impossible!

16:15.670 --> 16:16.530
I just...

16:17.830 --> 16:19.000
I'm his landlady.

16:19.000 --> 16:20.300
I'm her tenant.

16:20.830 --> 16:21.670
Landlady?

16:22.470 --> 16:23.760
How is that possible?

16:23.830 --> 16:25.670
You are my boss's landlady?

16:25.830 --> 16:27.000
Your vibe is way

16:27.000 --> 16:29.200
poorer than his, Qian Fei.

16:30.160 --> 16:31.670
Even if you are his landlady,

16:31.670 --> 16:34.940
how can a landlady live with her tenant?

16:35.430 --> 16:37.820
Bro, we are sharing the apartment, okay?

16:38.040 --> 16:39.670
I gave him one room in my place,

16:39.670 --> 16:41.130
and I live in the other one.

16:41.360 --> 16:42.070
Got it?

16:42.160 --> 16:43.380
Got it?

16:43.470 --> 16:44.200
Impossible.

16:44.400 --> 16:45.190
Absolutely impossible.

16:45.190 --> 16:46.330
Why?

16:47.520 --> 16:48.710
I just...

16:49.900 --> 16:51.870
have a special situation at home.

16:52.190 --> 16:53.710
You won't understand even if I tell you.

16:53.710 --> 16:55.640
Anyway, her place is decent,

16:55.750 --> 16:56.800
so I'm sharing it temporarily.

16:56.800 --> 16:58.320
Temporarily, got it?

17:00.160 --> 17:02.990
It still doesn't make sense to me.

17:02.730 --> 17:05.890
[Dressing Room]
[Please Go to the Fitness Center]

17:04.470 --> 17:06.160
You two live together.

17:06.160 --> 17:08.230
Why don't you ever get off work together?

17:08.230 --> 17:08.950
Yeah.

17:08.990 --> 17:09.920
We were afraid

17:09.920 --> 17:11.579
you'd judge us just like this.

17:11.599 --> 17:12.880
If you think she's my girlfriend,

17:12.880 --> 17:14.609
it would make my taste look bad.

17:14.670 --> 17:15.829
Come on.

17:15.880 --> 17:17.150
I was worried people would think

17:17.150 --> 17:18.390
I'm keeping a gigolo

17:18.410 --> 17:19.400
who doesn't even know how to sweet-talk

17:19.400 --> 17:20.560
or deal with people.

17:21.640 --> 17:22.359
To be honest,

17:22.359 --> 17:24.540
judging by your sharp tongues,

17:24.950 --> 17:26.010
you guys really are

17:26.400 --> 17:27.480
a good match.

17:27.750 --> 17:28.920
-Get out!
-Go to hell!

17:28.920 --> 17:29.820
We're so not.

17:32.410 --> 17:33.940
[Go to the bridal house with me.]

17:42.750 --> 17:44.400
Why are you sighing?

17:45.840 --> 17:46.870
Whenever I think

17:46.890 --> 17:48.900
that I affected Lu Ze's company,

17:49.080 --> 17:51.070
I don't know how to tell Jingjing.

17:51.470 --> 17:53.400
Is there something wrong with you?

17:53.470 --> 17:55.270
Lu Ze failed to manage his company well.

17:55.270 --> 17:57.130
What does that have to do with you?

17:57.470 --> 17:59.880
Simple-minded people like you
wouldn't understand.

17:59.880 --> 18:02.680
I don't understand overthinkers
like you either.

18:07.000 --> 18:08.490
[Jingjing]

18:12.090 --> 18:13.090
Hello, Jingjing.

18:13.120 --> 18:14.460
You're off work, right?

18:14.920 --> 18:16.180
You didn't reply to me.

18:16.560 --> 18:17.430
Where are you?

18:17.560 --> 18:18.690
Are you going or not?

18:19.190 --> 18:20.430
Yes, I am.

18:21.250 --> 18:22.420
See you later then.

18:32.670 --> 18:33.490
Hurry.

18:33.510 --> 18:35.310
How do you like my design?

18:35.470 --> 18:36.960
This is so cozy.

18:44.160 --> 18:45.080
What's wrong?

18:45.230 --> 18:46.840
You didn't say much in the car.

18:46.840 --> 18:47.640
Are you tired?

18:48.880 --> 18:49.840
A little.

18:50.920 --> 18:53.920
You designed
and bought everything here by yourself?

18:56.600 --> 18:59.410
It's just that Lu Ze is too busy.

18:59.560 --> 19:01.030
From the renovation until now,

19:01.030 --> 19:03.290
he hasn't had time
to come and take a look.

19:03.710 --> 19:05.990
But it's also because
their parent company is going public.

19:05.990 --> 19:07.950
The subsidiaries need to provide

19:07.950 --> 19:09.160
all the reports and materials.

19:09.160 --> 19:11.360
What can he do? He just has to cooperate.

19:11.840 --> 19:13.870
Will Lu Ze be here later?

19:13.990 --> 19:16.390
I don't know.
He's not answering his phone.

19:16.670 --> 19:17.600
Never mind him.

19:18.470 --> 19:21.330
I think I can get some green plants
for this area.

19:21.400 --> 19:22.050
Right?

19:22.080 --> 19:23.680
A taller one.

19:23.990 --> 19:24.800
And here—

19:24.800 --> 19:27.510
a small fish tank on this little stand.

19:27.530 --> 19:29.340
Put some small fish in to swim around.

19:29.340 --> 19:30.670
It would be full of life.

19:31.600 --> 19:34.380
Jingjing, I want to tell you something.

19:35.430 --> 19:36.160
It's just...

19:38.510 --> 19:39.440
Answer it first.

19:41.600 --> 19:42.560
Hello.

19:43.710 --> 19:45.670
Yes, Fei and I are at our place.

19:46.230 --> 19:46.880
Let me tell you.

19:46.880 --> 19:48.600
Everything is ready now.

19:48.620 --> 19:50.820
We're just missing the man of the house.

19:50.840 --> 19:53.170
Make some time to come over
and take a look.

19:53.750 --> 19:56.010
I think it's great. I'm super satisfied.

20:02.750 --> 20:03.230
Okay.

20:03.840 --> 20:05.170
I know. Get back to work.

20:06.120 --> 20:06.920
What's wrong?

20:08.320 --> 20:09.600
He told us to eat without him.

20:09.600 --> 20:11.660
He has something to do and can't come.

20:13.400 --> 20:15.600
What were you going to say to me just now?

20:16.800 --> 20:18.800
I was saying
you should come home with me tonight.

20:18.800 --> 20:19.750
I'll cook for you.

20:19.750 --> 20:20.210
Really?

20:21.230 --> 20:22.150
Really?

20:22.560 --> 20:23.400
Let's go.

20:24.430 --> 20:25.560
Let's go.

20:41.420 --> 20:45.150
[About Xinxin Vision]

20:51.270 --> 20:55.300
[About Xinxin Vision,
you should tell Jingjing]

21:04.920 --> 21:06.120
Jingjing, I'll be ready soon.

21:06.120 --> 21:07.920
Try that steamed cured meat first.

21:07.920 --> 21:10.080
Do I even need to taste it?
It smells so good.

21:10.080 --> 21:11.510
I'm getting hungry just looking at it.

21:11.510 --> 21:13.840
Is there anything
that doesn't make you hungry?

21:13.840 --> 21:15.700
If I had half your cooking skills,

21:15.840 --> 21:16.840
all the men in the world

21:16.840 --> 21:18.650
would probably be in my pocket.

21:19.080 --> 21:20.800
Don't they say
that the way to a man's heart

21:20.800 --> 21:22.150
is through his stomach?

21:24.600 --> 21:25.800
Which man cheats on his partner

21:25.800 --> 21:28.320
just because the other woman cooks well?

21:30.640 --> 21:31.430
Well...

21:32.270 --> 21:33.030
I made too much.

21:33.030 --> 21:34.010
Do you want to join us?

21:34.010 --> 21:34.600
No.

21:35.840 --> 21:37.500
Someone already asked me out.

21:38.710 --> 21:39.600
If...

21:40.190 --> 21:42.120
you want to have dinner with me too,

21:42.640 --> 21:43.400
next time,

21:43.800 --> 21:45.400
remember to book in advance.

22:04.670 --> 22:04.920
Seriously?

22:04.920 --> 22:06.790
How can he be so full of himself?

22:06.920 --> 22:09.120
I'm used to it. He's like this every day.

22:16.710 --> 22:18.190
How is the sweet and sour balance?

22:18.190 --> 22:18.870
Is it okay?

22:20.080 --> 22:22.140
I think it could be a tiny bit sweeter.

22:22.320 --> 22:23.980
Okay, I'll know for next time.

22:25.640 --> 22:26.330
By the way.

22:26.600 --> 22:27.270
Well...

22:29.160 --> 22:31.530
If Lu Ze's company...

22:32.190 --> 22:32.640
If...

22:32.750 --> 22:34.100
If, I mean if.

22:34.160 --> 22:36.400
If Lu Ze's company had some problems,

22:36.400 --> 22:37.600
what would you do?

22:38.510 --> 22:40.110
What problems could he have?

22:40.270 --> 22:42.400
If he has problems, I'll just
keep doing my own thing, right?

22:42.400 --> 22:43.550
I don't rely on him.

22:44.800 --> 22:45.850
That's true,

22:45.890 --> 22:47.840
but you two are getting married after all.

22:47.840 --> 22:49.370
You two are on the same boat.

22:53.510 --> 22:55.240
Take your time eating, you two.

22:55.900 --> 22:56.850
I'm heading out.

22:59.160 --> 23:01.020
Just leave. Why so much nonsense?

23:03.920 --> 23:06.650
Hey, remember
to lock the door when you come back.

23:07.160 --> 23:07.710
Okay.

23:21.080 --> 23:22.550
Why are you so naggy?

23:22.920 --> 23:25.280
If I don't tell him, he won't get it.

23:25.570 --> 23:28.710
Otherwise, I'll have to get up
in the middle of the night to lock it.

23:28.710 --> 23:29.320
By the way.

23:30.840 --> 23:31.400
Well...

23:32.030 --> 23:33.160
If Lu...

23:35.080 --> 23:36.280
Who is it at this hour?

23:39.840 --> 23:40.600
Who is it?

23:44.400 --> 23:45.430
Wang Ruohai?

23:46.950 --> 23:47.950
Why are you here?

23:48.320 --> 23:49.950
I... I called you, but you didn't answer,

23:49.950 --> 23:50.840
so I came up.

23:51.920 --> 23:53.030
Jingjing, you're here too?

23:53.030 --> 23:54.360
What are you doing here?

23:54.840 --> 23:55.840
Let's talk inside.

23:55.840 --> 23:56.400
No.

24:00.110 --> 24:01.880
Just say it here. What is it?

24:03.510 --> 24:04.840
The money for the house—

24:04.990 --> 24:07.450
can you transfer it to me
as soon as possible?

24:08.720 --> 24:09.550
Now?

24:12.990 --> 24:13.720
You...

24:13.840 --> 24:15.120
You said you were in no hurry before,

24:15.120 --> 24:16.450
so I didn't get it ready.

24:17.610 --> 24:19.070
I wasn't in a hurry before,

24:19.600 --> 24:21.710
but I've run into
a tricky situation recently

24:21.710 --> 24:23.110
and need money urgently.

24:23.360 --> 24:24.560
I really had no choice,

24:24.560 --> 24:25.820
so I came to you.

24:25.920 --> 24:27.510
But I really don't have

24:27.510 --> 24:28.640
that much money right now.

24:28.640 --> 24:29.430
How about this?

24:29.430 --> 24:30.270
As soon as I have the money,

24:30.270 --> 24:31.560
I will definitely
transfer it to you, okay?

24:31.560 --> 24:33.080
I'll give it to you as soon as possible.

24:33.080 --> 24:34.680
Can you give me an exact date?

24:35.270 --> 24:37.190
How could she give you an exact date?

24:37.190 --> 24:38.950
She already said
she'll pay you back as soon as possible.

24:38.950 --> 24:40.880
I really have no other choices now.

24:41.120 --> 24:41.780
Otherwise,

24:41.800 --> 24:43.930
I wouldn't need to be like this, right?

24:44.230 --> 24:45.230
How much is left?

24:45.880 --> 24:46.470
500,000.

24:46.670 --> 24:48.030
So much money?

24:48.670 --> 24:50.400
How could she get it all at once?

24:51.030 --> 24:51.940
By magic?

24:52.080 --> 24:53.230
Do you think everyone is like you,

24:53.230 --> 24:55.160
breaking up and changing your attitude
in just one day?

24:55.160 --> 24:57.030
What does that have to do with this?

24:57.030 --> 24:58.320
Fine. Then let's stop talking.

24:58.320 --> 24:58.990
No, no, no.

24:59.470 --> 25:00.840
There's something else.

25:00.840 --> 25:03.440
Bro, can you just finish
your sentence at once?

25:07.030 --> 25:07.560
Qian Fei,

25:08.400 --> 25:11.600
can you...
leave the Shan Li Fang due diligence team?

25:12.400 --> 25:13.230
Why?

25:13.470 --> 25:14.600
Don't get agitated.

25:15.660 --> 25:16.880
I don't mean anything else.

25:16.880 --> 25:17.430
On one hand,

25:17.430 --> 25:18.840
I think it's too much trouble for you.

25:18.840 --> 25:20.440
Taking the subway is tiring.

25:20.600 --> 25:21.560
On the other hand,

25:21.560 --> 25:22.840
I can go talk to

25:22.920 --> 25:24.900
Mr. Kong at He Jing Securities

25:24.990 --> 25:27.120
and arrange another position for you.

25:29.330 --> 25:30.910
Because of our relationship,

25:30.910 --> 25:33.510
the pressure from public opinion
is just too great.

25:33.510 --> 25:34.260
I think

25:34.400 --> 25:36.530
this won't do any good for either of us.

25:36.700 --> 25:37.960
Wait. What do you mean?

25:38.140 --> 25:39.510
If she can't pay you back,

25:39.510 --> 25:41.310
she has to get out of Shan Li Fang?

25:41.320 --> 25:42.430
Is she an eyesore to you,

25:42.430 --> 25:42.840
or is she getting in the way

25:42.840 --> 25:44.670
of your romance
with that rich girl of yours?

25:44.670 --> 25:46.710
-Don't go too far.
-What's the point of saying this?

25:46.710 --> 25:48.920
Why do you always have to be so sarcastic?

25:48.920 --> 25:50.470
I didn't mean that at all.

25:50.470 --> 25:51.510
Alright.

25:52.030 --> 25:53.430
Let me ask you something.

25:53.840 --> 25:56.580
If she refuses and can't pay you back,

25:56.640 --> 25:58.360
can you promise not to cause trouble

25:58.360 --> 25:59.640
and get her fired from Shan Li Fang?

25:59.640 --> 26:00.770
We were classmates.

26:01.140 --> 26:01.690
We were classmates.

26:01.690 --> 26:03.710
-Why are you always picking on me?
-I'm asking you a question!

26:03.710 --> 26:04.320
I told you that...

26:04.320 --> 26:05.160
Enough, Wang Ruohai.

26:05.160 --> 26:06.620
I'll answer you right now.

26:07.430 --> 26:10.400
I will return the money to you
as soon as possible, okay?

26:10.400 --> 26:12.160
Whether I stay in or leave
the project team is my business.

26:12.160 --> 26:13.760
It has nothing to do with you.

26:13.990 --> 26:16.120
You're the one who's afraid of rumors.

26:16.120 --> 26:18.120
Don't pretend to care about me here.

26:18.160 --> 26:19.820
That's your biggest problem.

26:19.840 --> 26:21.600
You never dare to face your own heart.

26:21.600 --> 26:23.860
Instead, you push the blame onto others.

26:24.430 --> 26:25.960
Alright, you can leave now.

26:26.080 --> 26:27.120
And never come back.

26:27.120 --> 26:28.360
This is my home, my house.

26:28.360 --> 26:29.960
It has nothing to do with you.

26:29.990 --> 26:30.670
Qian Fei.

26:30.950 --> 26:32.080
Let me explain.

26:32.080 --> 26:33.730
Hey, don't block the door!

26:33.780 --> 26:36.470
-Alright. Let go.
-Don't push me.

26:36.540 --> 26:38.080
-Stop blocking the door.
-Why are you always picking on me?

26:38.080 --> 26:39.030
Let me finish.

26:39.400 --> 26:40.950
Why are you always picking on me?

26:40.950 --> 26:41.950
That's enough, Wang Ruohai.

26:41.950 --> 26:43.990
-I said I would pay you back as soon as possible.
-Alright.

26:43.990 --> 26:44.800
Yes, I know.

26:44.950 --> 26:46.920
Don't push me.
Why are you always picking on me?

26:46.920 --> 26:47.750
What are you doing?

26:47.750 --> 26:49.340
Can't we talk this over?

26:49.560 --> 26:50.620
What are you doing?

26:52.320 --> 26:53.180
Stop fighting!

26:53.430 --> 26:55.810
Run! Leave me alone!

26:55.920 --> 26:57.290
Leave me alone! Run!

26:57.430 --> 26:58.560
-Run! Leave me alone!
-Stop!

26:58.560 --> 26:59.710
-Call the police!
-Let go!

26:59.710 --> 27:00.430
Call the police!

27:00.430 --> 27:00.920
Wang Ruohai!

27:00.920 --> 27:01.780
Stop fighting!

27:07.160 --> 27:09.010
Director Wang, why is it you?

27:09.800 --> 27:10.400
Are you okay?

27:10.400 --> 27:10.850
Ouch.

27:10.990 --> 27:11.770
In the middle of the night,

27:11.770 --> 27:14.500
I thought a thug in a suit
was breaking in to rob us.

27:17.120 --> 27:19.700
Quick,
help Director Wang with the bandaging.

27:19.700 --> 27:20.930
Alright, alright.

27:21.360 --> 27:21.990
Alright.

27:23.710 --> 27:24.450
Go back.

27:26.560 --> 27:27.800
Be careful.

27:26.820 --> 27:28.100
[No piling on public stairs]

27:28.360 --> 27:30.430
Go inside. Hurry, get in.

27:36.500 --> 27:37.750
[No piling on public stairs]

27:44.270 --> 27:44.880
Alright.

27:45.430 --> 27:46.240
I'm sorry.

27:46.270 --> 27:47.600
I didn't know it was you.

27:48.080 --> 27:49.180
I'm sorry.

27:51.600 --> 27:53.080
Are you okay?

27:53.270 --> 27:53.800
I'm fine.

27:54.030 --> 27:54.840
Are you okay?

27:54.950 --> 27:55.920
What could be wrong with me?

27:55.920 --> 27:57.320
I'm so manly and healthy.

27:57.640 --> 27:58.970
Come on. What happened?

27:59.270 --> 28:00.530
Don't even mention it.

28:00.670 --> 28:02.700
Today is so bizarre.

28:03.160 --> 28:05.690
Why did this jinx
deliver himself to our door?

28:05.750 --> 28:06.600
So unlucky.

28:07.360 --> 28:09.820
By the way,
why did you come back so suddenly?

28:09.990 --> 28:12.070
I forgot my car keys.

28:13.840 --> 28:15.570
You should thank him properly.

28:18.710 --> 28:19.600
So, what now?

28:19.670 --> 28:20.920
Should I stay a bit longer?

28:20.920 --> 28:23.120
In case there's another home invasion?

28:23.400 --> 28:24.020
No need.

28:24.360 --> 28:25.290
Go do your thing.

28:26.360 --> 28:27.840
Alright then, I'm leaving.

28:27.840 --> 28:28.700
By the way.

28:41.710 --> 28:42.510
Um...

28:46.850 --> 28:47.660
Thank you.

28:48.120 --> 28:49.850
Don't just thank me with words.

28:50.820 --> 28:52.220
Cook a nice meal instead.

28:53.050 --> 28:56.250
Don't just wait until you cook too much
and can't finish it

28:57.030 --> 28:58.430
to remember to invite me.

28:59.790 --> 29:00.390
Bye-bye.

29:01.360 --> 29:02.400
Off you go!

29:03.990 --> 29:04.670
Oh, right.

29:08.190 --> 29:09.120
After I leave,

29:11.800 --> 29:13.260
remember to lock the door.

29:18.560 --> 29:19.160
Bye-bye.

29:23.950 --> 29:24.700
Bye-bye.

29:25.920 --> 29:28.190
Your tenant is pretty interesting.

29:30.510 --> 29:32.170
Do you still have an appetite?

29:33.080 --> 29:33.920
I'm tired too.

29:34.510 --> 29:36.770
Let's take a break before we keep eating.

29:38.190 --> 29:39.400
What a mess.

29:44.670 --> 29:46.130
Are you done calculating?

29:48.160 --> 29:49.690
How is it? Can you pay it off?

29:50.270 --> 29:51.730
Don't even think about it.

29:53.030 --> 29:54.680
My salary is fixed.

29:54.950 --> 29:58.080
Even if the Shan Li Fang Hotel Group project
gets approved,

29:58.080 --> 30:00.280
I won't get a bonus until it's finished,

30:00.670 --> 30:01.920
which is still a long way off.

30:01.920 --> 30:03.670
I'm short by a lot.

30:04.400 --> 30:05.910
Then let me lend it to you.

30:06.470 --> 30:07.430
No, thanks.

30:08.080 --> 30:09.680
That's robbing Peter to pay Paul.

30:09.680 --> 30:11.120
You are getting married soon,

30:11.120 --> 30:13.120
so it's exactly when you need money.

30:14.360 --> 30:16.120
You are just

30:17.950 --> 30:19.840
the type who'd rather wrong yourself

30:19.840 --> 30:21.270
than bother others.

30:23.120 --> 30:25.450
What's going on with Wang Ruohai?

30:25.710 --> 30:27.470
When you broke up, he said it himself

30:27.470 --> 30:29.190
that there was no rush to pay him back.

30:29.190 --> 30:31.120
But now he's going back on his word?

30:31.270 --> 30:32.800
He knows you can't come up with it,

30:32.800 --> 30:34.160
so he asks you to leave Shan Li Fang.

30:34.160 --> 30:36.400
What is this? Isn't this blackmail?

30:37.950 --> 30:39.840
Let me tell you,
he just wants you to leave

30:39.840 --> 30:42.440
so that Liao Shiyu
won't be unhappy seeing you.

30:42.750 --> 30:44.030
He is such a jerk.

30:45.230 --> 30:46.080
Yeah.

30:46.950 --> 30:49.880
But if we fight with a jerk,
won't we become jerks too?

30:51.320 --> 30:51.950
How about

30:52.190 --> 30:54.510
I figure out a way
to make some extra money?

30:54.510 --> 30:56.640
Maybe he really has his difficulties.

30:57.670 --> 30:59.450
You are not being kind.

30:59.560 --> 31:01.050
Speaking up for such a jerk

31:01.080 --> 31:02.340
is just being a coward.

31:02.920 --> 31:03.360
Let me tell you.

31:03.360 --> 31:05.230
If you dare to say another word for him,

31:05.230 --> 31:06.750
I will gouge my eyes out

31:06.800 --> 31:09.600
and put them next to your pillow
to stare at you every day.

31:09.600 --> 31:12.600
Okay, I'll listen to you.

31:13.230 --> 31:14.840
Go home now.

31:15.710 --> 31:16.840
Clean this up later.

31:52.900 --> 31:54.840
[I'm in the car.
I'll tell you when I get home.]

32:05.920 --> 32:07.780
I hesitated for a long time today.

32:07.840 --> 32:09.900
There's something I didn't tell you.

32:10.510 --> 32:11.750
Part of my work at

32:11.750 --> 32:13.120
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

32:13.120 --> 32:15.950
involves Lu Ze's company, Xinxin Vision.

32:16.670 --> 32:19.670
I had no idea
Xinxin Vision was going to be divested...

32:40.750 --> 32:42.320
You planned

32:42.320 --> 32:43.430
the entire spin-off of Xinxin Vision

32:43.430 --> 32:45.030
before Shan Li Fang goes public.

32:45.030 --> 32:47.030
Why didn't you tell me?

32:47.640 --> 32:49.770
You could have at least told Jingjing.

32:50.190 --> 32:52.080
I was caught completely off guard.

32:52.080 --> 32:52.530
I...

32:53.750 --> 32:55.670
I really don't understand.

32:58.030 --> 32:59.190
Liao Shiyu told me

32:59.190 --> 33:00.990
you planned the whole proposal.

33:05.270 --> 33:06.270
Why does the new plan

33:06.270 --> 33:08.380
have to affect Lu Ze's company?

33:09.400 --> 33:10.430
Why did Lu Ze

33:10.430 --> 33:12.270
insist that I tell Jingjing?

33:12.400 --> 33:13.860
How am I supposed to say it?

33:18.920 --> 33:19.920
You're just staring at me

33:19.920 --> 33:21.050
and saying nothing.

33:21.600 --> 33:23.730
What's the point of having you around?

33:50.320 --> 33:50.950
Boss.

33:51.750 --> 33:52.780
Boss.

33:53.640 --> 33:55.110
Stop playing with your phone.

33:55.110 --> 33:57.800
I organized this gathering
especially for you today.

33:57.800 --> 33:59.220
The girl coming later

33:59.510 --> 34:00.800
is a future star.

34:00.820 --> 34:02.280
She'll be here in a minute.

34:02.990 --> 34:04.610
I'm talking to you. Who are you texting?

34:04.610 --> 34:06.010
The future star... Wait.

34:06.070 --> 34:09.760
[When are you coming back?]

34:06.400 --> 34:07.730
Mind your own business.

34:08.239 --> 34:09.639
When are you coming back?

34:09.949 --> 34:10.630
What's up?

34:17.920 --> 34:18.760
Nothing.

34:19.110 --> 34:20.440
You must be hanging out.

34:20.810 --> 34:22.670
Nothing important. Just asking.

34:30.620 --> 34:31.969
Qi, let me tell you.

34:32.070 --> 34:33.920
You don't need to introduce him
to any sweet girls anymore.

34:33.920 --> 34:35.110
He's not interested.

34:35.110 --> 34:38.040
He fell for his tomboy landlady.

34:39.320 --> 34:39.949
No way.

34:39.949 --> 34:40.630
That landlady

34:40.630 --> 34:42.159
doesn't seem like his type.

34:42.949 --> 34:44.110
I don't believe it.

34:44.469 --> 34:46.199
Leave the girl next door alone.

34:46.280 --> 34:47.239
You have no idea.

34:47.239 --> 34:47.989
Our Yifei

34:48.020 --> 34:50.280
is not only seriously in love this time,

34:50.800 --> 34:52.239
but also doesn't have the courage
to pursue her.

34:52.239 --> 34:53.350
Are you serious?

34:53.590 --> 34:56.280
She said she would never like him.

34:56.300 --> 34:58.760
If she did,
she would be struck by lightning,

34:58.760 --> 35:00.890
go bankrupt, and end up on the streets.

35:01.030 --> 35:01.800
Our Yifei,

35:01.820 --> 35:03.720
for her own safety,

35:03.840 --> 35:06.650
can only keep his love in his heart.

35:08.760 --> 35:10.660
Boss, wake up.

35:10.760 --> 35:12.200
Are you possessed by someone?

35:12.200 --> 35:13.200
Are you still you?

35:13.550 --> 35:14.890
What are you two doing?

35:15.760 --> 35:18.180
Putting on a double act?
What play is this?

35:18.400 --> 35:20.320
You're talking about me.
What about yourself?

35:20.320 --> 35:21.950
Have you made any progress?
I'd like to ask.

35:21.950 --> 35:22.430
All you do every day

35:22.430 --> 35:23.650
is play games.

35:23.950 --> 35:25.550
You're getting dumb from it.

35:25.990 --> 35:26.590
And you.

35:29.110 --> 35:30.990
I really have nothing to say about you.

35:30.990 --> 35:32.430
Alright, it's about time. I'm leaving.

35:32.430 --> 35:33.950
Where are you going?

35:34.070 --> 35:35.840
I'm going home. I'm hungry.
I want a late-night snack.

35:35.840 --> 35:38.090
Isn't all this food enough for you?

35:38.200 --> 35:40.370
It doesn't taste as good as
what his landlady cooks.

35:40.370 --> 35:42.170
Then you should just find a chef.

35:42.400 --> 35:43.550
What's wrong with my landlady?

35:43.550 --> 35:44.750
My landlady is great.

35:44.800 --> 35:47.010
She never does things like being late.

35:47.150 --> 35:48.880
I just simply can't stand

35:48.880 --> 35:51.200
women who use being late
to show off their arrogance.

35:51.200 --> 35:52.320
I'm not talking to you anymore. I'm off.

35:52.320 --> 35:54.080
I'm sorry. I'm late.

35:54.240 --> 35:55.950
I don't know what happened,
but the traffic was terrible.

35:55.950 --> 35:57.200
It's fine.

35:59.030 --> 36:00.490
How is she? Not bad, right?

36:00.800 --> 36:01.630
What are you doing?

36:01.630 --> 36:02.950
Isn't this what Zihao does?

36:02.950 --> 36:04.720
How did you get led astray?

36:05.430 --> 36:08.060
This is called keeping my word.

36:08.280 --> 36:10.290
Come, let me introduce you.

36:11.320 --> 36:12.950
This is my boss Li Yifei. This is Jin.

36:12.950 --> 36:13.540
Hello.

36:13.720 --> 36:15.590
I'm going to
formally introduce someone to you.

36:15.590 --> 36:16.280
Jun.

36:16.920 --> 36:18.470
-I'm not important. I'm not.
-Hello.

36:18.470 --> 36:19.990
-He is. He's good at playing games.
-He's not important.

36:19.990 --> 36:21.120
He's not important.

36:22.240 --> 36:23.670
My boss...

36:23.760 --> 36:24.920
He is usually...

36:25.200 --> 36:27.260
shy.

36:27.550 --> 36:28.810
Please don't mind him.

36:31.640 --> 36:32.550
[Do you have any food left?
I'll eat it as dinner when I'm home]

36:40.240 --> 36:41.640
Do you have any food left?

36:41.680 --> 36:43.610
I'll eat it as dinner when I'm home.

36:44.200 --> 36:46.260
All you do is eat!

37:11.590 --> 37:12.710
[Shiyu]

37:30.150 --> 37:30.680
Hello.

37:30.920 --> 37:31.520
What's up?

37:31.680 --> 37:33.840
Ruohai, why are you outside?

37:31.860 --> 37:35.100
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

37:34.200 --> 37:35.260
What are you doing?

37:36.510 --> 37:39.220
I was a bit tired from work today.

37:39.340 --> 37:41.110
I came out for a walk to relax.

37:41.360 --> 37:42.890
Why is it so dark over there?

37:43.470 --> 37:45.130
I can't see your face clearly.

37:45.760 --> 37:46.910
I want to see you.

37:47.110 --> 37:48.760
Can't you see me when I get back?

37:48.760 --> 37:49.200
No.

37:49.630 --> 37:51.040
I want to see you right now.

37:51.040 --> 37:53.590
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

37:51.430 --> 37:53.290
Look, isn't it bright behind you?

37:53.550 --> 37:55.380
I can see it. Go over there.

37:55.680 --> 37:56.200
Okay.

38:01.910 --> 38:05.930
[Microphone On] [Speaker On] [Camera On]

38:07.840 --> 38:08.510
Ruohai,

38:09.070 --> 38:10.760
what happened to your nose?

38:11.950 --> 38:13.410
Nothing. I just bumped it.

38:15.760 --> 38:17.290
It doesn't look like a bump.

38:18.070 --> 38:18.930
Tell the truth.

38:21.840 --> 38:22.900
The taxi driver...

38:22.990 --> 38:25.140
and I had a little beef,

38:25.400 --> 38:26.660
and we got into a fight.

38:27.470 --> 38:28.110
It's fine.

38:28.760 --> 38:30.570
Why were you so impulsive?

38:31.110 --> 38:33.200
You should call the police
for this kind of thing.

38:33.200 --> 38:35.460
It's a small matter. Why call the police?

38:37.840 --> 38:39.280
I'm coming over to see you right now.

38:39.280 --> 38:41.810
It's so late. Why are you coming over
to see me?

38:41.880 --> 38:43.240
I have to come over
no matter how late it is.

38:43.240 --> 38:45.240
You're injured. Wait for me.

38:54.680 --> 38:56.630
Alright, that's about it.
I'll leave now.

38:56.630 --> 38:57.630
Don't go.

38:58.510 --> 38:59.990
She's going to sing in a bit.

38:59.990 --> 39:01.590
Just stay a few more minutes.

39:05.470 --> 39:06.590
That's her?

39:08.800 --> 39:09.950
She can sing?

39:10.800 --> 39:11.990
Indeed.

39:12.720 --> 39:14.470
Not bad. Let's listen.

39:16.110 --> 39:18.110
Hello everyone, I'm Jin.

39:18.280 --> 39:19.880
Today I want to sing a song

39:19.880 --> 39:22.250
I wrote myself.

39:22.280 --> 39:23.280
It's an original?

39:31.550 --> 39:32.860
She is a

39:32.950 --> 39:33.810
professional.

39:33.990 --> 39:34.920
Really?

39:39.010 --> 39:45.210
♪ There used to be
too many sweet memories ♪

39:46.200 --> 39:48.330
Would any girl I introduce to you be bad?

39:46.720 --> 39:53.280
♪ I never wanted to leave ♪

39:48.360 --> 39:49.950
Yes, yes. It sounds great.

39:50.280 --> 39:51.290
See?

39:54.360 --> 40:01.030
♪ There's so much familiar scent ♪

40:02.080 --> 40:04.740
♪ So much ♪

40:05.920 --> 40:06.920
It sounds great.

40:07.320 --> 40:08.630
It's really not bad.

40:09.720 --> 40:11.950
Her voice is really nice.

40:10.390 --> 40:17.420
♪ You have to remember
that I came here bravely ♪

40:18.260 --> 40:24.760
♪ I want to say thank you for loving me ♪

40:25.310 --> 40:31.880
♪ I will continue
to protect you in heaven ♪

40:32.660 --> 40:38.520
♪ A small home, a warm nest ♪

40:51.470 --> 40:53.490
Not bad. You can't judge a book
by its cover.

40:53.490 --> 40:54.840
-She's amazing.
-Good job.

40:54.840 --> 40:56.280
Bravo! Bravo!

40:56.310 --> 40:57.060
Come.

40:57.080 --> 41:00.260
That was very nice.

41:00.360 --> 41:01.690
-Thank you.
-Well done.

41:01.880 --> 41:03.280
Okay, I'm leaving now.

41:03.510 --> 41:04.910
Are you leaving already?

41:05.320 --> 41:06.950
You're in such a hurry to go home.

41:06.950 --> 41:07.950
Do you have a

41:07.950 --> 41:09.400
very beautiful girlfriend at home?

41:09.400 --> 41:09.920
Of course.

41:09.920 --> 41:12.440
His girlfriend is not only beautiful,

41:12.470 --> 41:13.630
but also a great cook.

41:13.630 --> 41:14.550
No wonder.

41:15.200 --> 41:16.520
I am a great cook too.

41:16.550 --> 41:18.680
Do you want to taste my cooking, Yifei?

41:18.720 --> 41:19.360
Really?

41:19.950 --> 41:21.150
That's amazing.

41:21.150 --> 41:22.550
You can sing and cook.

41:22.550 --> 41:23.400
Maybe next time.

41:23.400 --> 41:25.330
-Let's meet again next time, okay?
-Yeah.

41:25.330 --> 41:25.660
Okay.

41:25.840 --> 41:26.550
Next time for sure.

41:26.550 --> 41:27.550
Okay.

41:31.760 --> 41:33.560
Why didn't you turn on the light?

41:40.150 --> 41:41.070
Let me see.

41:43.470 --> 41:45.400
Who did this? He hit you so hard.

41:47.720 --> 41:49.780
Did you see his license plate number?

41:50.400 --> 41:52.600
I'm fine. They're just minor injuries.

41:54.070 --> 41:55.520
Minor injuries?

41:55.720 --> 41:58.250
A little closer
and it would have hit your eye.

42:00.550 --> 42:01.610
Take a few days off.

42:02.760 --> 42:03.590
A few days off?

42:05.680 --> 42:06.360
Forget it.

42:07.630 --> 42:09.120
Why?

42:09.590 --> 42:10.880
I mean,

42:10.950 --> 42:12.620
regarding the company's IPO,

42:12.800 --> 42:14.600
there is still a lot of work to do.

42:15.400 --> 42:17.530
There's no need to rush these few days.

42:20.310 --> 42:20.910
Ruohai.

42:22.070 --> 42:23.320
About today,

42:24.150 --> 42:25.750
you didn't lie to me, did you?

42:28.240 --> 42:29.990
No. What are you thinking?

42:32.390 --> 42:33.320
That's good.

42:37.360 --> 42:39.400
No matter what happens in the future,

42:39.400 --> 42:40.860
you must tell me the truth.

42:51.990 --> 42:53.660
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.530 --> 42:56.630
Did you save this food
specifically for me?

42:56.630 --> 42:57.320
Why?

42:57.620 --> 42:59.590
You helped me teach Wang Ruohai a lesson.

42:59.590 --> 43:00.380
So thank you.

43:03.200 --> 43:05.330
I'll heat up the food for you, alright?

43:08.400 --> 43:09.650
I just want to know why.

43:09.650 --> 43:11.280
I put in so much effort

43:11.280 --> 43:12.800
and finally found a new buyer

43:12.800 --> 43:14.150
to take over Xinxin Vision.

43:14.150 --> 43:14.920
Li Yifei!

43:15.310 --> 43:16.960
You rejected this plan!

43:17.840 --> 43:18.470
Come out!

43:18.490 --> 43:19.480
Get out of my way!

43:20.510 --> 43:21.470
That's enough! Stop it!

43:21.470 --> 43:22.360
Stop it!

43:22.190 --> 43:22.990
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]
